msgid "Version 4.1.5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.5.rst:4
msgid "Release Date: November 8, 2021"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.5.rst:6
msgid "**4.1.5 release of CodeIgniter4**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.5.rst:13
msgid "BREAKING"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.5.rst:15
msgid ""
"Fixed `a bug <https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/issues/2913>`_"
" on CSRF protection. Now CSRF protection works on PUT/PATCH/DELETE "
"requests when CSRF filter is applied. If you use such requests, you need "
"to send CSRF token."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.5.rst:16
msgid ""
"In the previous version, if you didn't provide your own headers, "
"``CURLRequest`` would send the request-headers from the browser, due to a"
" bug. As of this version, it does not send them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.5.rst:17
msgid ""
"Fixed ``BaseBuilder::insertBatch()`` return value for ``testMode``. Now "
"it returns SQL string array instead of a number of affected rows. This "
"change was made because of maintaining compatibility between returning "
"types for batch methods. Now the returned data type for "
"``BaseBuilder::insertBatch()`` is the same as the `updateBatch()` method."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.1.5.rst:18
msgid ""
"Major optimizations have been made to the way data is processed in "
"``BaseBuilder::insertBatch()`` and ``BaseBuilder::updateBatch()`` "
"methods. This resulted in reduced memory usage and faster query "
"processing. As a trade-off, the result generated by the "
"``$query->getOriginalQuery()`` method was changed. It no longer returns "
"the query with the binded parameters, but the actual query that was run."
msgstr ""

